<title>USA: Gradco unit to buy back 4.27 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Gradco unit to buy back 4.27 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gradco Systems Inc Thursday said its Gradco Japan unit plans to buy back 4.27 million shares of stock for about $11 million.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the transaction will be completed shortly after a special stockholder meeting of Gradco Japan to be held on June 27.</p>
</text>
